## 1. Purpose and License Classification

This License makes source code available for reading, inspection, audit, analysis, and reference when independently developing other software. You may install, execute, evaluate, and test Official Packages and Unmodified Builds.

This License permits building unmodified source code, using and redistributing the resulting Unmodified Builds, and including them in Your own commercial products. It does **not** grant a general right to modify the Software, build or use modified versions, or create derivative works.

Accordingly, this License is a **source-available license** and is not intended to qualify as an Open Source license under the Open Source Initiative definition.

All rights not expressly granted by this License are reserved by the Licensor.

